<title>USA: Raymond James cuts Universal Electronics.</title>
<headline>Raymond James cuts Universal Electronics.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James said it cut its rating on Universal Electronics Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Shares fell 7/8 to 7-5/8.</p>
</text>
